(C68a, F4 T6f, class D guard, owner decision 2026-10-18: one Maxwell
 chain {E_c 7e3, tau 0.3} on a homogeneous uniaxial strain path: two
 quad4, poisson 0, top edge moved at vely -0.01 on a unit height, so
 the strain rate is r = -0.01 for t in {0,1}, 10 steps of dt 0.1.
 Chain law: dmsig/dt = E_c r - msig/tau, msig{0} = 0, hence the exact
 solution msig{t} = E_c tau r {1 - exp{-t/tau}}.
 At t = 1: 7e3 * 0.3 * -0.01 * {1 - exp{-1/0.3}} = -20.2508461397
 (the bound |msig| < E_c tau |r| = 21 holds for every t). For a
 constant rate the exponential update of the chain is exact for any
 dt, so the target is analytic at 1e-6 relative.
 Professional 02-08-2026 on the same input: -23.8131 at dt 0.1 (beyond
 the bound 21), -20.5902 at dt 0.01, -20.2846 at dt 0.001: a first-order
 time-discretisation error, DIVERGENCES C68a class D.
 The total stress is E eptyy + msig = -70 - 20.2508461397.)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_stress
materi_strain_total
materi_maxwell_stress 1
end_initia
node 1 0 0
node 2 1 0
node 3 2 0
node 4 0 1
node 5 1 1
node 6 2 1
element 1 -quad4 1 2 4 5
element 2 -quad4 2 3 5 6
bounda_dof 0 1 -velx -vely
bounda_time 0 0. 0. 1.e10 0.
bounda_dof 1 2 -vely
bounda_time 1 0. 0. 1.e10 0.
bounda_dof 2 3 -vely
bounda_time 2 0. 0. 1.e10 0.
bounda_dof 3 4 -vely
bounda_time 3 0. -0.01 1.e10 -0.01
bounda_dof 4 5 -vely
bounda_time 4 0. -0.01 1.e10 -0.01
bounda_dof 5 6 -vely
bounda_time 5 0. -0.01 1.e10 -0.01
group_type 0 -materi
group_materi_elasti_young 0 7.e3
group_materi_elasti_poisson 0 0.
group_materi_memory 0 -total_linear
group_materi_maxwell_chain 0 7.e3 0.3
control_timestep 10 0.1 1.
target_item 0 -node_dof 1 -1msigyy
target_value 0 -2.02508461397e+01 2.0e-05
target_item 1 -node_dof 5 -1msigyy
target_value 1 -2.02508461397e+01 2.0e-05
target_item 2 -node_dof 6 -sigyy
target_value 2 -9.02508461397e+01 9.0e-05
end_data
